The *-symbolic.svg files in this directory are cut out of the icon sheets
of the Sosumi Plasma desktop theme (Sosumi-Dark, version 2.3.6) by
import_sosumi.py. That theme is distributed under the GNU Lesser General
Public License (LGPL), which permits use within this GPL-3.0 project.
Changes: each glyph was extracted into a standalone SVG; battery icons are
composed from the theme's outline, fill-level and charger elements.
